      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BatteryHint">
      <segment>
        <source>Some phones stop background apps aggressively. Exclude NetworkControl from battery optimization if protection turns off by itself.</source>
        <target state="translated">部分手機會積極停止背景應用程式。若保護會自行關閉，請將 NetworkControl 排除在電池最佳化之外。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
